  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BOS Religion Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BOS religionsprojekt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BOS skall undervisa unga m&#xE4;nniskor i de olika religionernas roll och bakgrund p&#xE5; Balkan. Syftet &#xE4;r att minska de sp&#xE4;nningar som ofta motiveras med religi&#xF6;sa sk&#xE4;l. Man ska diskutera religionernas inb&#xF6;rdes relationer och deras inflytande p&#xE5; samh&#xE4;llet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Belgrade Open School will educate young people regarding the role and background of the different religions in the Balkans. The goal is to reduce tensions, frequently motivated with religious reasons. BOS will also discuss the mutual relations between the religions and their influence upon other segments of the society.</narrative>
  </description>
